9.Create Validation Rule on Policy Object:
Go to object manager, Search for the policy object and click on policy object
In the left side panel, scroll down and find validation rules and click on it
Click on New

Give the rule name as VIN_Must_Be_17_Characters
Check the active checkbox
Write the following formula in the formula editor
AND( RecordType.DeveloperName = "Auto", LEN( VIN__c )<> 17)
For error message, The Vehicle Identification Number (VIN) must be exactly 17 characters long for Auto Policies.
Select error location as field and select VIN field
Click on Save








